      "summary": "Rays of Belief Limited has informed the Exchange regarding a press release dated October 01, 2026, titled \"Rays of Belief Ltd (Mom s Belief) Unaudited Financial Results (Standalone & Consolidated) for the Quarter ended June 30, 2026\".",
      "pdf_link": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ROBL_01102026153845_Press_Release_Financial_Results.pdf",
      "pdf_extracted_text": "Rays of Belief Limited Date: October 01, 2026 To, To, The Manager The Manager – Listing Department Listing Department National Stock Exchange of India Limited BSE Limited Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G Bandra Kurla Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Complex, Bandra (E) Mumbai – 400051 Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400001. Sub: Press release-“Rays of Belief Ltd (Mom’s Belief) Unaudited Financial Results (Standalone & Consolidated) for the Quarter ended June 30, 2026. Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, please find enclosed herewith a Press Release dated October 01, 2026, titled “Rays of Belief Ltd (Mom’s Belief) Unaudited Financial Results (Standalone & Consolidated) for the Quarter ended June 30, 2026. The Press Release is enclosed for your information and dissemination on the Stock Exchange website. Kindly take the above information on record. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For Rays of Belief Limited (Formerly known as Rays of Belief Private Limited) Mayank Bhargava Company Secretary ICSI Mem. No. A53418 Rays of Belief Limited (Formerly known as Rays of Belief Private Limited) Corp office - 18/1, T Block, Near DLF City Club, DLF Phase III, Sector 24, Gurugram 122001,INDIA Tel: 0124-4075498; Email: contact@momsbelief.com Regd. Office – J-1919, Basement, Chittranjan Park, New Delhi – 110 019; CIN: U85110DL2017PLC322623 Rays of Belief Limited (Mom’s Belief) Reports 136.45% Revenue Growth and ₹27.87 Mn Net Profit Gurugram | September 30, 2026: Rays of Belief Limited (Mom’s Belief) BSE: 544906, a provider of child development and behavioural healthcare services specialising in autism, ADHD and other neurodevelopmental disorders, has reported strong financial performance, with significant revenue growth, improved operating margins and a turnaround to profitability. Key Financial Highlights – Q1 FY27 • Revenue from Operations: ₹253.14 Mn, registering 136.45% YoY growth • EBITDA: ₹50.77 Mn, up 865.21% YoY • EBITDA Margin: 20.06%, an improvement of 1,515 bps • Net Profit: ₹27.87 Mn, marking a turnaround to profitability • Net Profit Margin: 11.01%, up 1,603 bps • EPS: ₹1.78, marking a turnaround to profitability Management Commentary Mr. Nitin Bindlish, Managing Director, Rays of Belief Limited (Mom’s Belief), said: “We are pleased to report strong financial performance, with revenue from operations growing 136.45% YoY to ₹253.14 Mn and EBITDA increasing 865.21% YoY to ₹50.77 Mn. Our EBITDA margin improved to 20.06%, up 1,515 BPS, while we achieved a turnaround to profitability, reporting a net profit of ₹27.87 Mn and a net profit margin of 11.01%, up 1,603 BPS, we remain focused on strengthening our presence in child development and behavioural healthcare through our therapy centres and digital programmes.” About Rays of Belief Ltd (Mom’s Belief) Rays of Belief Limited operates primarily under the Mom’s Belief brand and provides personalised intervention programmes for children with neurodevelopmental needs. Its multidisciplinary services include Early Intervention, occupational therapy, speech and language intervention, behavioural support, special education, parent guidance and family-support programmes. Mom’s Belief operates 136 centres across India and is developing a broader developmental-care ecosystem combining clinical services, family participation, professional development, technology and structured care delivery. In FY26, the company achieved ₹816.62 Mn in Revenue"
    },
