 Palsana Road, Palsana, Surat-394315, Gujarat, India. Tel+91 9601281648 Website: www.rnbdenims.com Email:- info@rnbdenims.com CIN:L17120GJ2010PLC062949 Annexure – I Disclosure under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015: Sr. No. Particulars Details 1 Industry or area to which The new line of business pertains to the polyester the new line of business yarn manufacturing, specifically production of belongs spun polyester yarn. This marks a value chain synchronisation of the Company’s existing denim fabric manufacturing operations. 2 Expected benefits The value chain synchronisation is intended to strengthen the Company’s textile value chain by providing greater control over the sourcing and quality of yarn, improving supply-chain efficiencies, optimizing input costs and supporting the Company’s manufacturing operations. This venture into polyester yarn manufacturing is a strategic move aimed at enhancing the Company’s value proposition, improving profitability, and ensuring long-term sustainability. The expected benefits include: - Complete quality control of yarn manufacturing. - Better utilization of existing manufacturing infrastructure and human resources. - Diversification of revenue streams, reducing the impact of fabric market fluctuations. 3 Estimated amount to be Currently Ricon Industries has invested invested approximately Rs. 25 crores as an initial capital outlay to cover machinery, skilled manpower, and infrastructure modifications. Furt"
